"6044","ibne-Juraij ne kaha : mujhey abu-Zubair ne bataya ke unhon-ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ko kehtey huey suna, maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna hai : kisi se koi marz khud b-khud nahi lag jata, na safar (ki nahoosat (aur na chhalawa koi cheez hai. (ibne-Juraij ne kaha : ( maine abu-Zubair ko ye zikr kartey huey suna ke Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne unke samney Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke farman ( وَلَا صَفَر ( ki wazaahat ki, abu-Zubair ne kaha : safar pet (ki bimari) hai. Hazrat Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha gaya : kaisey ? unhon-ne kaha : kaha jata tha ke us se pet ke andar banney waley janwar murad hain. kaha : unhon-ne ghol ki tashreeh nahi ki, albatta abu-Zubair ne kaha : ye ghol (wahi hai jiske barey mein kaha jata hai) jo rang badaltaa hai (aur musaafiron ko rastey se bhatka kar mar daalta hai.)"
