"6046","Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Ubaidullah-bin-Abdullaah-bin-Utba se riwayat ki ke Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna : bad shagooni ki koi haqiqat nahi aur shagoon mein se achi nek faal hai. kaha gaya. Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! faal kya hai? (wo shagoon se kis tarah mukhtalif hai? (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ( faal ( nek kalima hai jo tum mein se koi shakhs sunta hai َ ."
