"6048","Aqeel-bin-Khalid aur Shuaib donon ne Zohri se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki. Aqeel ki hadis mein hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne maine suna ke alfaz nahi kahey aur Shuaib ki hadis mein hai. unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna. jis tarah Mamar ne kaha."
"6049","Aqeel-bin-Khalid aur Shuaib donon ne Zohri se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah riwayat ki. Aqeel ki hadis mein hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne maine suna ke alfaz nahi kahey aur Shuaib ki hadis mein hai. unhon-ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna. jis tarah Mamar ne kaha."
"6050","Hammam bin Yahya ne kaha : hamein Qatada ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kisi se koi marz khud b-khud nahi lagta burey shagoon ki koi haqiqat nahi aur (iske bilmuqaabil) nek faal yani hosla afzaai ka achchha kalima pakeeza baat mujhey achi lagti hai."
"6051","Hammam bin Yahya ne kaha : hamein Qatada ne Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kisi se koi marz khud b-khud nahi lagta burey shagoon ki koi haqiqat nahi aur (iske bilmuqaabil) nek faal yani hosla afzaai ka achchha kalima pakeeza baat mujhey achi lagti hai."
"6052","Shoba ne kaha : maine Qatada se suna, wo Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis riwayat kar rahe they ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kisi se koi marz khud b-khud nahi lagta bura shagoon koi cheez nahi aur mujhey nek faal achi lagti hai. kaha aap se puchha gaya : nek faal kya hai? farmaya : pakeeza kalima. (duaaya hosla afzaai ya daanaai wala koi jumla.)"
"6053","Shoba ne kaha : maine Qatada se suna, wo Hazrat Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis riwayat kar rahe they ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kisi se koi marz khud b-khud nahi lagta bura shagoon koi cheez nahi aur mujhey nek faal achi lagti hai. kaha aap se puchha gaya : nek faal kya hai? farmaya : pakeeza kalima. (duaaya hosla afzaai ya daanaai wala koi jumla.)"
"6054","Yahya bin Ateeq ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin Sirin ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kisi se lazimi taur par bimari lag janey ki koi haqiqat nahi bad shagooni koi cheez nahi aur main achi faal ko pasand karta hun."
"6055","Yahya bin Ateeq ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin Sirin ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kisi se lazimi taur par bimari lag janey ki koi haqiqat nahi bad shagooni koi cheez nahi aur main achi faal ko pasand karta hun."
"6056","Hisham bin Hassan ne Muhammad-bin Sirin se unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : lazimi taur par khud b-khud kisi se bimari lag janey ki koi haqiqat nahi, khopdi se ullu nikalna koi cheez nahi, bad shagooni kuchh nahi aur main nek faal ko pasand karta hun."
"6057","Hisham bin Hassan ne Muhammad-bin Sirin se unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : lazimi taur par khud b-khud kisi se bimari lag janey ki koi haqiqat nahi, khopdi se ullu nikalna koi cheez nahi, bad shagooni kuchh nahi aur main nek faal ko pasand karta hun."
"6058","Imam Malik ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke 2 beton, Hamza aur Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : adam muwafiqat (naa-sazaadaari) ghar , aurat aur ghodey mein ho sakti hai."
"6059","Imam Malik ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke 2 beton, Hamza aur Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : adam muwafiqat (naa-sazaadaari) ghar , aurat aur ghodey mein ho sakti hai."
"6060","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke 2 beton Hamza aur Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kisi se khud b-khud marz ka lag jana aur bad shagooni ki koi haqiqat nahi. naamuwaafiqat teen chizon mein hoti hai. aurat ghodey aur ghar mein."
"6061","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke 2 beton Hamza aur Salim se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kisi se khud b-khud marz ka lag jana aur bad shagooni ki koi haqiqat nahi. naamuwaafiqat teen chizon mein hoti hai. aurat ghodey aur ghar mein."
"6062","Sufiyan, Saleh, aqeel, bin Khalid, Abdur-Rehman bin Ishaq aur Shuaib, un sab ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne apne walid ( ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) se unhon-ne naamuwaafiqat ke barey mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Imam Malik ki hadis ki tarah bayan kya, Yunus bin Yazeed ke ilawa unmein se kisi ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis mein kisi bimari ke khud-b-khud kisi doosrey ko lag janey aur bad shagooni ka zikr nahi kya."
"6063","Sufiyan, Saleh, aqeel, bin Khalid, Abdur-Rehman bin Ishaq aur Shuaib, un sab ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne apne walid ( ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) se unhon-ne naamuwaafiqat ke barey mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Imam Malik ki hadis ki tarah bayan kya, Yunus bin Yazeed ke ilawa unmein se kisi ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis mein kisi bimari ke khud-b-khud kisi doosrey ko lag janey aur bad shagooni ka zikr nahi kya."
"6064","Muhammad-bin-Jafar ne kaha : hamein Shoba ne Umar-bin Muhammad-bin Yazeed se hadis bayan ki unhon-ne apne walid se suna, wo Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se hadis bayan kar rahe they ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : agar kisi cheez mein kisi naamuwaafiqat ka hona barhaq ho sakta hai to wo ghodey aurat aur makan mein hai."
