"6076","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-Auf se, unhon-ne Hazrat Muawiya bin-Hakam Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! kuchh kaam aisey they jo ham zamana jahiliyat mein kya kartey they. ham kaahinon ke paas jatey they Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tum kaahinon ke paas na jaya karo. maine kaha : ham bad shagooni letey they, aap ne farmaya : ye ( badshigooni) mahz aik khayal hai jo koi insan apne dil mein mehsus karta hai, ye tumhen (kisi kaam se) na rokey ."
"6077","Yunus ne ibne-Shahab se, unhon-ne abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-Auf se, unhon-ne Hazrat Muawiya bin-Hakam Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! kuchh kaam aisey they jo ham zamana jahiliyat mein kya kartey they. ham kaahinon ke paas jatey they Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tum kaahinon ke paas na jaya karo. maine kaha : ham bad shagooni letey they, aap ne farmaya : ye ( badshigooni) mahz aik khayal hai jo koi insan apne dil mein mehsus karta hai, ye tumhen (kisi kaam se) na rokey ."
"6078","Aqeel Mamar , ibne-abi-Ze-ib aur Malik , un sab ne Zohri se isi sanad ke sath Yunus ki hadis ke ham mana riwayat ki, magar Malik ne apni hadis mein badshigoonii ka naam liya hai, usmein kaahinon ka zikr nahi."
"6079","Aqeel Mamar , ibne-abi-Ze-ib aur Malik , un sab ne Zohri se isi sanad ke sath Yunus ki hadis ke ham mana riwayat ki, magar Malik ne apni hadis mein badshigoonii ka naam liya hai, usmein kaahinon ka zikr nahi."
"6080","Hajjaj sawaaf aur Auzai , donon ne Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir se, unhon-ne Hilal bin abi Memuna se, unhon-ne Ata-bin-Yasar se, unhon-ne Muawiya bin-Hakam Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Zohri ki abu-Salma se aur unki Muawiya se riwayat ki hui hadis ki tarah riwayat ki, aur Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir ki hadis mein ye alfaz zayed bayan kiye, kaha : maine kaha : ham mein aisey log hain jo ( mustaqbil ka haal batane ke liye) lakeerein kheenchtey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : anbiya (Alaihissalam) mein se aik Nabi they jo lakeerein kheenchtey they, jo unki lakeeron se muwafiqat kar gaya to wo theek hai."
"6081","Hajjaj sawaaf aur Auzai , donon ne Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir se, unhon-ne Hilal bin abi Memuna se, unhon-ne Ata-bin-Yasar se, unhon-ne Muawiya bin-Hakam Salma (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Zohri ki abu-Salma se aur unki Muawiya se riwayat ki hui hadis ki tarah riwayat ki, aur Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir ki hadis mein ye alfaz zayed bayan kiye, kaha : maine kaha : ham mein aisey log hain jo ( mustaqbil ka haal batane ke liye) lakeerein kheenchtey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : anbiya (Alaihissalam) mein se aik Nabi they jo lakeerein kheenchtey they, jo unki lakeeron se muwafiqat kar gaya to wo theek hai."
"6082","Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Yahya bin Urwa-bin-Zubair se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! kaahin kisi cheez ke barey mein jo hamein bataya kartey they ( unmein se kuchh ( ham durust patey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo sachchi baat hoti hai jisey koi jin uchak leta hai aur wo usko apne dost ( kaahin (ke kaan mein phoonk deta hai aur us aik sach mein so jhoot mila deta hai."
"6083","Mamar ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Yahya bin Urwa-bin-Zubair se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine kaha : Allah ke rasool! kaahin kisi cheez ke barey mein jo hamein bataya kartey they ( unmein se kuchh ( ham durust patey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo sachchi baat hoti hai jisey koi jin uchak leta hai aur wo usko apne dost ( kaahin (ke kaan mein phoonk deta hai aur us aik sach mein so jhoot mila deta hai."
"6084","Maaqil bin Ubaidullah ne Zohri se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Yahya bin Urwa ne bataya ke unhon-ne Urwa se suna, wo keh rahe they ke Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaahinon ke mutaalliq sawal kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo kuchh nahi hain. sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne kaha : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)! wo log kabhi-kabhi aisi cheez bataatey hain jo sach nikalti hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo jinon ki baat hoti hai, aik jin usey (aasman ke nichey se) uchak leta tha phir wo usey apne dost (kaahin) ke kaan mein murghi ki kat-kat ki tarah katkataata rehta hai. aur wo us (eik ( baat mein so se zyada jhoot mila deta hai."
"6085","Maaqil bin Ubaidullah ne Zohri se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Yahya bin Urwa ne bataya ke unhon-ne Urwa se suna, wo keh rahe they ke Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaahinon ke mutaalliq sawal kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo kuchh nahi hain. sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne kaha : Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)! wo log kabhi-kabhi aisi cheez bataatey hain jo sach nikalti hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : wo jinon ki baat hoti hai, aik jin usey (aasman ke nichey se) uchak leta tha phir wo usey apne dost (kaahin) ke kaan mein murghi ki kat-kat ki tarah katkataata rehta hai. aur wo us (eik ( baat mein so se zyada jhoot mila deta hai."
"6086","ibne-Juraij ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath Maaqil ki Zohri se riwayat ki hui hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6087","ibne-Juraij ne ibne-Shahab se isi sanad ke sath Maaqil ki Zohri se riwayat ki hui hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6088","Saleh ne ibne-Shahab se, riwayat ki : kaha mujhey Ali-bin Husain ( Zainul-Aabedeen ( ne hadis sunai ke Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sathiyon mein se aik Ansari ne mujhey bataya ke aik baar wo log raat ke waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath baithey huey they. ke aik sitaarey se kisi cheez ko nishana banaya gaya aur wo roshan ho gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : jab jahiliyat mein is tarah sitaarey se nishana lagaya jata tha. to tum log kya kaha kartey they? logon ne kaha : Allah aur uska rasool zyada jaanney waley hain ham yahi kaha : kartey they. ke aaj raat kisi azeem insan ki wilaadat hui hai aur koi azeem insan faut hua hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : usey kisi ki zindagi ya maut ki bina par nishaaney ki taraf nahi chhoda jata, balke hamara rab, uska naam barkat wala aur uncha hai, jab kisi kaam ka faisla farmata hai to arsh waaley ( zor se) tasbeeh kartey hain, phir unse nichey waley aasman ke Farishtey tasbeeh ka wird kartey hain. yahan tak ke tasbeeh ka wird (duniya ke) us aasman tak pahunch jata hai, phir arsh walon ke qareeb ke Farishtey arsh walon se poochhtey hain tumharey parwardigar ne kya farmaaya? wo unhein batatey hain ke usne kya farmaya. phir ( mukhtalif ( aasmanon waley aik doosrey se poochhtey hain, yahan tak ke wo khabar duniya ke us aasman tak pahunch jati hai to jin bhi jaldi se uski kuchh sun-gun uchaktey hain aur apne doston ( kaahinon ( tak de phainktey hain (is khabar ko pahuncha detey hain) jo khabar wo sahi taur par latey hain wo sach to hoti hai lekin wo usmein jhoot milatey aur izafa kar detey hain."
"6089","Saleh ne ibne-Shahab se, riwayat ki : kaha mujhey Ali-bin Husain ( Zainul-Aabedeen ( ne hadis sunai ke Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sathiyon mein se aik Ansari ne mujhey bataya ke aik baar wo log raat ke waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath baithey huey they. ke aik sitaarey se kisi cheez ko nishana banaya gaya aur wo roshan ho gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : jab jahiliyat mein is tarah sitaarey se nishana lagaya jata tha. to tum log kya kaha kartey they? logon ne kaha : Allah aur uska rasool zyada jaanney waley hain ham yahi kaha : kartey they. ke aaj raat kisi azeem insan ki wilaadat hui hai aur koi azeem insan faut hua hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : usey kisi ki zindagi ya maut ki bina par nishaaney ki taraf nahi chhoda jata, balke hamara rab, uska naam barkat wala aur uncha hai, jab kisi kaam ka faisla farmata hai to arsh waaley ( zor se) tasbeeh kartey hain, phir unse nichey waley aasman ke Farishtey tasbeeh ka wird kartey hain. yahan tak ke tasbeeh ka wird (duniya ke) us aasman tak pahunch jata hai, phir arsh walon ke qareeb ke Farishtey arsh walon se poochhtey hain tumharey parwardigar ne kya farmaaya? wo unhein batatey hain ke usne kya farmaya. phir ( mukhtalif ( aasmanon waley aik doosrey se poochhtey hain, yahan tak ke wo khabar duniya ke us aasman tak pahunch jati hai to jin bhi jaldi se uski kuchh sun-gun uchaktey hain aur apne doston ( kaahinon ( tak de phainktey hain (is khabar ko pahuncha detey hain) jo khabar wo sahi taur par latey hain wo sach to hoti hai lekin wo usmein jhoot milatey aur izafa kar detey hain."
"6090","Auzai , Yunus aur Maaqil bin Ubaidullah sab ne Zohri se, isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, magar Yunus ne kaha : Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai : mujhey Ansar mein se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne khabar di aur Auzai ki hadis mein hai. lekin wo usmein jhoot milatey hain aur badhatey hain. aur Yunus ki hadis mein hai : lekin wo uncha ley jatey hain (mubaalgha kartey hain) aur badhaatey hain. Yunus ki hadis mein mazeed ye hai : Allah Taala ne farmaya : yahan tak ke jab unke dilon se haibat aur dar ko hata liya jata hai to wo kehtey hain. tumharey rab ne kya kaha ? wo kehtey hain. haq kaha, aur Maaqil ki hadis mein usi ki tarah hai jis tarah Auzai ne kaha : lekin wo usmein jhoot milatey hain aur izafa kartey hain."
"6091","Auzai , Yunus aur Maaqil bin Ubaidullah sab ne Zohri se, isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, magar Yunus ne kaha : Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai : mujhey Ansar mein se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne khabar di aur Auzai ki hadis mein hai. lekin wo usmein jhoot milatey hain aur badhatey hain. aur Yunus ki hadis mein hai : lekin wo uncha ley jatey hain (mubaalgha kartey hain) aur badhaatey hain. Yunus ki hadis mein mazeed ye hai : Allah Taala ne farmaya : yahan tak ke jab unke dilon se haibat aur dar ko hata liya jata hai to wo kehtey hain. tumharey rab ne kya kaha ? wo kehtey hain. haq kaha, aur Maaqil ki hadis mein usi ki tarah hai jis tarah Auzai ne kaha : lekin wo usmein jhoot milatey hain aur izafa kartey hain."
"6092","(hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki ahliya) Safiya ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik ahliya se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, ke aap ne farmaya : jo shakhs kisi ghaib ki khabrein sunaney waley ke paas aaey aur us se kisi cheez ke barey mein poochhey to chalis (40) raaton tak us shakhs ki Namaz qabool nahi hoti ."
"6093","(hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki ahliya) Safiya ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik ahliya se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, ke aap ne farmaya : jo shakhs kisi ghaib ki khabrein sunaney waley ke paas aaey aur us se kisi cheez ke barey mein poochhey to chalis (40) raaton tak us shakhs ki Namaz qabool nahi hoti ."
"6094","Amr bin shareed ne apne walid se riwayat ki, kaha : Saqif ke wafad mein kodh ka aik mareez bhi tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko paigham bheja : ham ne ( bilwaasta) tumhari bait ley li hai, isliye tum (apne ghar) lot jao."
"6095","Amr bin shareed ne apne walid se riwayat ki, kaha : Saqif ke wafad mein kodh ka aik mareez bhi tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko paigham bheja : ham ne ( bilwaasta) tumhari bait ley li hai, isliye tum (apne ghar) lot jao."
"6096","Abda bin Sulaiman aur ibne-Numair ne Hisham se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne peeth par 2 safaid lakeeron waley sanp ko qatl karne ka hukm diya, kyonke wo basaarat chheen leta hai. aur hamal ko nuqsan pahunchata hai."
"6097","Abda bin Sulaiman aur ibne-Numair ne Hisham se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne peeth par 2 safaid lakeeron waley sanp ko qatl karne ka hukm diya, kyonke wo basaarat chheen leta hai. aur hamal ko nuqsan pahunchata hai."
"6098","abu-Muawiya ne kaha : hamein Hisham ne is sanad ke sath hadis sunai aur kaha : be dam ka sanp aur pusht par 2 safaid lakeeron wala sanp (mar diya jaey. ("
"6099","abu-Muawiya ne kaha : hamein Hisham ne is sanad ke sath hadis sunai aur kaha : be dam ka sanp aur pusht par 2 safaid lakeeron wala sanp (mar diya jaey. ("
"6100","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne apne walid (hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki : saanpon ko qatl kar do aur) khususan ( 2 safaid lakeeron waley aur dam kate ko, kyonke ye hamal gira detey hain aur basaarat khatm kar detey hain. ( Salim ne) kaha : Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko jo bhi sanp milta wo usey mar daltey , aik baar Abu-Lubaaba bin abdul-munzir ya Zaid bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko dekha ke wo aik sanp ka peechha kar rahe they, to unhon-ne kaha : lambi muddat se gharon mein rehney waley saanpon ko (fauri taur par) mar deney se mana kya gaya hai."
"6101","Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Salim se, unhon-ne apne walid (hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu)) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki : saanpon ko qatl kar do aur) khususan ( 2 safaid lakeeron waley aur dam kate ko, kyonke ye hamal gira detey hain aur basaarat khatm kar detey hain. ( Salim ne) kaha : Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko jo bhi sanp milta wo usey mar daltey , aik baar Abu-Lubaaba bin abdul-munzir ya Zaid bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko dekha ke wo aik sanp ka peechha kar rahe they, to unhon-ne kaha : lambi muddat se gharon mein rehney waley saanpon ko (fauri taur par) mar deney se mana kya gaya hai."
"6102","Zubaidi ne Zohri se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Salim bin-Abdullah ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna aap (aawaara kutton ko maar dene ka hukm detey they, aap ne farmatey they : saanpon aur kutton ko maar 2 aur safaid dhaariyon waley aur dam katey sanp ko) zaroor ( maaro , wo donon basaarat zaayel kar detey hain aur haamla aurton ka hamal gira detey hain. Zohri ne kaha : hamara khayal hai ye un donon ke zahar ki bina par hota hai) sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke bataaney se aur unse taabeen aur muhaddeseen ne yahi mafhoom liya kya. yahi haqiqat hai, baqi Allah zyada janta hai. Salim ne kaha : Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : main aik arsa tak kisi bhi sanp ko dekhta to na chhorta. usey mar deta. aik roz mein muddat se ghar mein rehney waley aik sanp ka peechha kar raha tha ke Zaid bin-Khattab ya abu Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) mere paas se guzrey to kehney lagey : Abdullah! ruk jao . maine kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein mar deney ka hukm diya hai, unhon-ne kaha : beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muddat se gharon mein rehney waley saanpon (ke qatl ( se roka hai."
"6103","Zubaidi ne Zohri se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Salim bin-Abdullah ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khabar di kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna aap (aawaara kutton ko maar dene ka hukm detey they, aap ne farmatey they : saanpon aur kutton ko maar 2 aur safaid dhaariyon waley aur dam katey sanp ko) zaroor ( maaro , wo donon basaarat zaayel kar detey hain aur haamla aurton ka hamal gira detey hain. Zohri ne kaha : hamara khayal hai ye un donon ke zahar ki bina par hota hai) sahaba kiram (Rizwaanullahi anhum ajmaeen) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke bataaney se aur unse taabeen aur muhaddeseen ne yahi mafhoom liya kya. yahi haqiqat hai, baqi Allah zyada janta hai. Salim ne kaha : Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya : main aik arsa tak kisi bhi sanp ko dekhta to na chhorta. usey mar deta. aik roz mein muddat se ghar mein rehney waley aik sanp ka peechha kar raha tha ke Zaid bin-Khattab ya abu Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) mere paas se guzrey to kehney lagey : Abdullah! ruk jao . maine kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein mar deney ka hukm diya hai, unhon-ne kaha : beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muddat se gharon mein rehney waley saanpon (ke qatl ( se roka hai."
"6104","Yunus Mamar aur Saleh sab ne hamein Zohri se, isi sanad ke sath hadis sunai, albatta Saleh ne kaha : yahan tak ke abu Lubaba bin abdul-Munzir aur Zaid bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey ( sanp ka peechha kartey huey) dekha to donon ne kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muddat se gharon mein rehney waley saanpon se roka hai. aur Yunus ki hadis mein hai : saanpon ko qatl karo unhon-ne 2 safaid dhaariyon waley aur dam katey ke alfaz nahi kahey ."
"6105","Yunus Mamar aur Saleh sab ne hamein Zohri se, isi sanad ke sath hadis sunai, albatta Saleh ne kaha : yahan tak ke abu Lubaba bin abdul-Munzir aur Zaid bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey ( sanp ka peechha kartey huey) dekha to donon ne kaha : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muddat se gharon mein rehney waley saanpon se roka hai. aur Yunus ki hadis mein hai : saanpon ko qatl karo unhon-ne 2 safaid dhaariyon waley aur dam katey ke alfaz nahi kahey ."
"6106","Leis (bin Sad ( ne Naafe se riwayat ki ke Hazrat abu-Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se baat ki ke wo unke liye apne ghar (ke ihaatey) mein aik darwaza khol dein jis se wo masjid ke qareeb aa jayen to ladkon ko sanp ki aik keinchuli mili, Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : usko qatl mat karo, kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un chhipey huey saanpon ke maarney se mana farmaya hai jo gharon ke andar hotey hain."
"6107","Leis (bin Sad ( ne Naafe se riwayat ki ke Hazrat abu-Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se baat ki ke wo unke liye apne ghar (ke ihaatey) mein aik darwaza khol dein jis se wo masjid ke qareeb aa jayen to ladkon ko sanp ki aik keinchuli mili, Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : usko qatl mat karo, kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un chhipey huey saanpon ke maarney se mana farmaya hai jo gharon ke andar hotey hain."
"6108","Jareer-bin-Haazim ne kaha : hamein Naafe ne hadis sunai, kaha : Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) saanpon ko mar daltey they, yahan tak ke Hazrat abu-Lubaba-bin-abdul-Munzir (Raziallahu anhu) ne ham logon ko ye hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (muddat se) gharon mein rehney waley saanpon ko maarney se mana farmaya hai. phir Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ruk gaey."
"6109","Jareer-bin-Haazim ne kaha : hamein Naafe ne hadis sunai, kaha : Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) saanpon ko mar daltey they, yahan tak ke Hazrat abu-Lubaba-bin-abdul-Munzir (Raziallahu anhu) ne ham logon ko ye hadis bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (muddat se) gharon mein rehney waley saanpon ko maarney se mana farmaya hai. phir Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ruk gaey."
"6110","Ubaidullah ne kaha : mujhey Naafe ne bataya ke unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko hadis bayan kar rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( gharelu ( saanpon ke maarney se mana farmaya,"
"6111","Ubaidullah ne kaha : mujhey Naafe ne bataya ke unhon-ne Hazrat abu-Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko hadis bayan kar rahe they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( gharelu ( saanpon ke maarney se mana farmaya,"
"6112","Naafe se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan kya ke Hazrat abu Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un saanpon ko qatl karne se mana farmaya : jo gharon mein rahtey hain."
"6113","Naafe se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan kya ke Hazrat abu Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un saanpon ko qatl karne se mana farmaya : jo gharon mein rahtey hain."
"6114","saiyedna Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : pani mein maujood machhliyon ka Sauda na karo, kyonke usmein dhoka hai."
"6115","saiyedna Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : pani mein maujood machhliyon ka Sauda na karo, kyonke usmein dhoka hai."
"6116","Umar-bin Naafe ne apne walid se riwayat ki, kaha : aik din Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) apne ghar ke girey huey hissey ke qareeb maujood they ke unhon-ne achcha sanp ki aik keinchuli dekhi, Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya is sanp ko talash karke qatl kar do. Hazrat abu Lubaba Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap ne un saanpon ko, jo gharon mein rehtey hain qatl karne se mana farmaya, siwaey dam katey aur 2 safaid dhaariyon waley saanpon ke kyonke yahi 2 sanp hain jo nazar ko khatm kar detey hain aur aurton ke hamal ko nuqsan pahunchaatey hain."
"6117","Umar-bin Naafe ne apne walid se riwayat ki, kaha : aik din Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) apne ghar ke girey huey hissey ke qareeb maujood they ke unhon-ne achcha sanp ki aik keinchuli dekhi, Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya is sanp ko talash karke qatl kar do. Hazrat abu Lubaba Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap ne un saanpon ko, jo gharon mein rehtey hain qatl karne se mana farmaya, siwaey dam katey aur 2 safaid dhaariyon waley saanpon ke kyonke yahi 2 sanp hain jo nazar ko khatm kar detey hain aur aurton ke hamal ko nuqsan pahunchaatey hain."
"6118","Usama ko Naafe ne hadis sunai ke Hazrat abu Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas se guzrey, wo us qiley numaa hissey ke paas they jo wo Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ki rihaaish gaah ke qareeb tha, wo usmein aik sanp ki taak mein they, jis tarah Lais-bin-Sad ki (hadis : 5828) hai."
"6119","Usama ko Naafe ne hadis sunai ke Hazrat abu Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas se guzrey, wo us qiley numaa hissey ke paas they jo wo Hazrat umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ki rihaaish gaah ke qareeb tha, wo usmein aik sanp ki taak mein they, jis tarah Lais-bin-Sad ki (hadis : 5828) hai."
"6120","abu-Muawiya ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Ibrahim se, unhon-ne Aswad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik ghaar mein they, us waqt Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par) sura) ( وَالْمُرْسَلَاتِ عُرْفًا ( nazil hui, ham is sura ko taaza-b-taaza Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke dehane-mubarak se hasil kar (seekh) rahe they ke achcha aik sanp nikla, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : usko mar do. ham usko maarney ke liye jhaptey to wo ham se aagey bhag gaya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ne usko tumharey (hathon) nuqsan pahunchne se bacha liya jis tarah tumhen iske nuqsan se bacha liya."
"6121","abu-Muawiya ne Aamash se, unhon-ne Ibrahim se, unhon-ne Aswad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik ghaar mein they, us waqt Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par) sura) ( وَالْمُرْسَلَاتِ عُرْفًا ( nazil hui, ham is sura ko taaza-b-taaza Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke dehane-mubarak se hasil kar (seekh) rahe they ke achcha aik sanp nikla, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : usko mar do. ham usko maarney ke liye jhaptey to wo ham se aagey bhag gaya, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ne usko tumharey (hathon) nuqsan pahunchne se bacha liya jis tarah tumhen iske nuqsan se bacha liya."
"6122","Jarir ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6123","Jarir ne Aamash se isi sanad ke sath usi ki tarah hadis bayan ki."
"6124","abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein Hafs ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Aamash ne Ibrahim se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Aswad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Mina mein ehram waley aik shakhs ko sanp maarney ka hukm diya."
"6125","abu-Kuraib ne kaha : hamein Hafs ne hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne kaha : hamein Aamash ne Ibrahim se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Aswad se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Mina mein ehram waley aik shakhs ko sanp maarney ka hukm diya."
"6126","Umar-bin Hafs bin Ghiyas ne kaha : hamein mere walid ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Aamash ne hadis sunai, kaha : mujhey Ibrahim ne Aswad se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin Masood ( (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik ghaar mein they jis tarah Jarir aur abu-Muawiya ki hadis hai."
"6127","Umar-bin Hafs bin Ghiyas ne kaha : hamein mere walid ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein Aamash ne hadis sunai, kaha : mujhey Ibrahim ne Aswad se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin Masood ( (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik ghaar mein they jis tarah Jarir aur abu-Muawiya ki hadis hai."
"6128","imam Malik-bin-Anas ne, ibne- Aflah ke aazad karda ghulam saifii se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Hishaam-bin-Zohra ke aazad karda ghulam abu-Saaib ne bataya ke wo saiyedna Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas unke ghar gaey. abu-Saaib ne kaha ke maine unko Namaz mein paya to baith gaya. mein Namaz padh chukney ka muntazir tha ke itney mein un lakdiyon mein kuchh harkat ki awaz aai jo ghar ke koney mein rakhi thin. maine idhar dekha to aik sanp tha. main uske maarney ko douda to saiyedna abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne ishara kya ke baith jaa. main baith gaya jab Namaz se farigh huey to mujhey aik kothri dikhaatey huey puchha ke ye kothhri dekhtey ho? maine kaha ke haan, unhon-ne kaha ke usmein ham logon mein se aik jawan rehta tha, jiski nai-nai shadi hui thi. ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khandaq ki taraf nikley. wo jawan do-pahar ko Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat lekar ghar aaya karta tha. aik din Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat mangi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hathiyar lekar ja kyonke mujhey bani Qureza ka dar hai (jinhon ne daghabazi ki thi aur mauqa dekh kar mushrikon ki taraf ho gaey they). us shakhs ne apne hathiyar le liye. jab apne ghar par pahuncha to usne apni biwi ko dekha ke darwazey ke donon patton ke darmyan khadi hai. us ne ghairat se apna neza usey maarney ko uthaya to aurat ne kaha ke apna neza sanbhaal aur andar ja kar dekh to malum hoga ke main kyon nikli hun. wo jawan andar gaya to dekha ke aik bada sanp kundli maarey huey bichhoney par betha hai. jawan ne is par neza uthaya aur usey neze main piro liya, phir nikla aur neza ghar mein gaad diya. wo sanp is par lota iske baad ham nahi jantey ke sanp pahley mara ya jawan pahley Shahid hua. ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Sara qissa bayan kya aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! Allah se dua kijiye ke Allah Taala us jawan ko phir jalaa de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne sathi ke liye bakhshish ki dua karo. phir farmaya ke Madina mein jin rahtey hain jo musalman ho gaey hain, phir agar tum saanpon ko dekho to teen din tak unko khabardar karo, agar teen din ke baad bhi na niklein to unko mar dalo ke wo shaitan hain (yani kaafir jin hain ya shareer sanp hain) ."
"6129","imam Malik-bin-Anas ne, ibne- Aflah ke aazad karda ghulam saifii se riwayat ki, kaha : mujhey Hishaam-bin-Zohra ke aazad karda ghulam abu-Saaib ne bataya ke wo saiyedna Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas unke ghar gaey. abu-Saaib ne kaha ke maine unko Namaz mein paya to baith gaya. mein Namaz padh chukney ka muntazir tha ke itney mein un lakdiyon mein kuchh harkat ki awaz aai jo ghar ke koney mein rakhi thin. maine idhar dekha to aik sanp tha. main uske maarney ko douda to saiyedna abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne ishara kya ke baith jaa. main baith gaya jab Namaz se farigh huey to mujhey aik kothri dikhaatey huey puchha ke ye kothhri dekhtey ho? maine kaha ke haan, unhon-ne kaha ke usmein ham logon mein se aik jawan rehta tha, jiski nai-nai shadi hui thi. ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khandaq ki taraf nikley. wo jawan do-pahar ko Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat lekar ghar aaya karta tha. aik din Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat mangi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hathiyar lekar ja kyonke mujhey bani Qureza ka dar hai (jinhon ne daghabazi ki thi aur mauqa dekh kar mushrikon ki taraf ho gaey they). us shakhs ne apne hathiyar le liye. jab apne ghar par pahuncha to usne apni biwi ko dekha ke darwazey ke donon patton ke darmyan khadi hai. us ne ghairat se apna neza usey maarney ko uthaya to aurat ne kaha ke apna neza sanbhaal aur andar ja kar dekh to malum hoga ke main kyon nikli hun. wo jawan andar gaya to dekha ke aik bada sanp kundli maarey huey bichhoney par betha hai. jawan ne is par neza uthaya aur usey neze main piro liya, phir nikla aur neza ghar mein gaad diya. wo sanp is par lota iske baad ham nahi jantey ke sanp pahley mara ya jawan pahley Shahid hua. ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Sara qissa bayan kya aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! Allah se dua kijiye ke Allah Taala us jawan ko phir jalaa de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne sathi ke liye bakhshish ki dua karo. phir farmaya ke Madina mein jin rahtey hain jo musalman ho gaey hain, phir agar tum saanpon ko dekho to teen din tak unko khabardar karo, agar teen din ke baad bhi na niklein to unko mar dalo ke wo shaitan hain (yani kaafir jin hain ya shareer sanp hain) ."
"6130","Jareer-bin-Haazim ne kaha : maine Asma bin Ubaid ko aik aadmi se hadis bayan kartey huey suna, jisey Saaib kaha jata tha. wo hamarey nazdeek abu-Saaib hain. unhon-ne kaha : ham Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas hazir huey, ham baithey huey they jab ham ne unki charpaai ke nichey (kisi cheez ki) harkat ki awaz suni. ham ne dekha to wo aik sanp tha, phir unhon-ne poorey waqiey samet saifii se Imam Malik ki riwayat ki hui hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki, aur is mein kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : un gharon mein kuchh makhlooq abad hai. jab tum unmein se koi cheez dekho to teen din tak un par tangi karo (taake wo khud wahan se kahin aur chaley jayen) agar wo pahley jayen (to theek) warna unko mar 2 kyonke phir wo (na janey wala) kaafir hai. aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : jao aur apne sathi ko dafn kar do."
"6131","Jareer-bin-Haazim ne kaha : maine Asma bin Ubaid ko aik aadmi se hadis bayan kartey huey suna, jisey Saaib kaha jata tha. wo hamarey nazdeek abu-Saaib hain. unhon-ne kaha : ham Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas hazir huey, ham baithey huey they jab ham ne unki charpaai ke nichey (kisi cheez ki) harkat ki awaz suni. ham ne dekha to wo aik sanp tha, phir unhon-ne poorey waqiey samet saifii se Imam Malik ki riwayat ki hui hadis ki tarah hadis bayan ki, aur is mein kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : un gharon mein kuchh makhlooq abad hai. jab tum unmein se koi cheez dekho to teen din tak un par tangi karo (taake wo khud wahan se kahin aur chaley jayen) agar wo pahley jayen (to theek) warna unko mar 2 kyonke phir wo (na janey wala) kaafir hai. aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya : jao aur apne sathi ko dafn kar do."
"6132","ibne- Ajlan ne kaha : mujhey Saifii ne abu-Saaib se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine un (hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu)) ko ye kehtey huey suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Madina mein jinon ki kuchh nafri rehti hai jo musalman ho gaey hain jo shakhs un (puraaney) rihaaishon mein se kisi ko dekhey to teen din tak usey ( janey ko) kehta rahe. iske baad agar wo uske samney namudaar ho to usey qatl kar de, kyonke wo shaitan (eman na laney wala jin ( hai."
"6133","ibne- Ajlan ne kaha : mujhey Saifii ne abu-Saaib se hadis bayan ki, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : maine un (hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu)) ko ye kehtey huey suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Madina mein jinon ki kuchh nafri rehti hai jo musalman ho gaey hain jo shakhs un (puraaney) rihaaishon mein se kisi ko dekhey to teen din tak usey ( janey ko) kehta rahe. iske baad agar wo uske samney namudaar ho to usey qatl kar de, kyonke wo shaitan (eman na laney wala jin ( hai."
"6134","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba Amr-Naqid Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim aur ibne-abi-Umar ne hamein hadis bayan ki, Ishaq ne kaha : hamein khabar di jabke doosrey ne kaha : hamein hadis bayan ki, Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne abdul-Hameed bin Juber bin Sheba se, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se, unhon-ne Umme- Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein chhipkaliyon ko mar dalney ka hukm diya. ibne- Shoba ki riwayat main ( unko hukm diya ke bajaey sirf ( hukm diya hai."
"6135","abu-Bakar-bin-abi-Sheba Amr-Naqid Ishaq-bin-Ibrahim aur ibne-abi-Umar ne hamein hadis bayan ki, Ishaq ne kaha : hamein khabar di jabke doosrey ne kaha : hamein hadis bayan ki, Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne abdul-Hameed bin Juber bin Sheba se, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se, unhon-ne Umme- Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein chhipkaliyon ko mar dalney ka hukm diya. ibne- Shoba ki riwayat main ( unko hukm diya ke bajaey sirf ( hukm diya hai."
"6136","abu-Taahir ne kaha : hamein ibne- Wahab ne bataya kaha, mujhey ibne-Juraij ne khabar di aur Muhammad-bin Ahmed bin abi Khalaf ne kaha : hamein Rooh ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne hadis sunai aur abd bin Humaid ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Bakr ne bataya, kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne khabar di, kaha : mujhey abdul-Hameed bin Juber bin Sheba ne bataya , unhein Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne bataya, unhein Umme- Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) ne bataya ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se chhipkali ko maarney ke mutaalliq aap ka hukm puchha to aap ne usey mar deney ka hukm diya. Umme- Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) banu-Aamir bin Lui ki aik khatun thin (Muhammad-bin Ahmed) bin abi Khalaf aur abd bin Humaid ki hadis ke alfaz aik hain aur ibne- Wahab ki hadis us se qareeb hai."
"6137","abu-Taahir ne kaha : hamein ibne- Wahab ne bataya kaha, mujhey ibne-Juraij ne khabar di aur Muhammad-bin Ahmed bin abi Khalaf ne kaha : hamein Rooh ne hadis bayan ki, kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne hadis sunai aur abd bin Humaid ne kaha : hamein Muhammad-bin-Bakr ne bataya, kaha : hamein ibne-Juraij ne khabar di, kaha : mujhey abdul-Hameed bin Juber bin Sheba ne bataya , unhein Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne bataya, unhein Umme- Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) ne bataya ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se chhipkali ko maarney ke mutaalliq aap ka hukm puchha to aap ne usey mar deney ka hukm diya. Umme- Sharik (Raziallahu anhu) banu-Aamir bin Lui ki aik khatun thin (Muhammad-bin Ahmed) bin abi Khalaf aur abd bin Humaid ki hadis ke alfaz aik hain aur ibne- Wahab ki hadis us se qareeb hai."
"6138","Aamir-bin-Sad ne apne walid (hazrat Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chhipkali ko mar dene ka hukm diya aur iska naam chhoti fasiq rakha."
"6139","Aamir-bin-Sad ne apne walid (hazrat Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chhipkali ko mar dene ka hukm diya aur iska naam chhoti fasiq rakha."
"6140","abu-Taahir aur Hurmala ne kaha : hamein ibne- Wahab ne khabar di, kaha : mujhey Yunus ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Urwa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chhipkalii ko 'chhoti fasiq' kaha Hurmala ne (apni) riwayat mein ye izafa kya : (hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha : maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usko qatl karne ka hukm nahi suna."
"6141","abu-Taahir aur Hurmala ne kaha : hamein ibne- Wahab ne khabar di, kaha : mujhey Yunus ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Urwa se, unhon-ne Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chhipkalii ko 'chhoti fasiq' kaha Hurmala ne (apni) riwayat mein ye izafa kya : (hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) kaha : maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usko qatl karne ka hukm nahi suna."
"6142","Khalid-bin-Abdullaah ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis shakhs ne pehli chot mein chhipkali ko qatl kar diya uske liye itni itni nekiyan hain aur jisne dusri chot mein mara uske liye itni itni pehli se kam nekiyan hain aur agar teesri zarb se maara to itni itni nekiyan hain dusri se kam ( bataein.)"
"6143","Khalid-bin-Abdullaah ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : jis shakhs ne pehli chot mein chhipkali ko qatl kar diya uske liye itni itni nekiyan hain aur jisne dusri chot mein mara uske liye itni itni pehli se kam nekiyan hain aur agar teesri zarb se maara to itni itni nekiyan hain dusri se kam ( bataein.)"
"6145","abu-Awana Jareer, Ismail bin Zakariya aur Sufiyan sab ne Suhel se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, jis tarah Suhel se Khalid ki riwayat hai siwaey akeley Jarir ke unhon-ne apni riwayat ki hui hadis mein kaha : jisne chhipkali ko pehli chot mein mar diya uske liye so nekiyan likhi gain. dusri zarb mein us se kam aur teesri zarb mein us se kam."
"6146","Muhammad-bin Sabaah ne kaha : hamein Ismail bin Zakariya ne Suhel se hadis bayan ki unhon-ne kaha : mujhey meri behan ( Sauda binte- Abu-Saleh (Raziallahu anhu)) ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : pehli zarb mein 70 nekiyan hain."
"6147","Muhammad-bin Sabaah ne kaha : hamein Ismail bin Zakariya ne Suhel se hadis bayan ki unhon-ne kaha : mujhey meri behan ( Sauda binte- Abu-Saleh (Raziallahu anhu)) ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki, ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : pehli zarb mein 70 nekiyan hain."
"6148","Saeed-bin-Musaiyab aur abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : (pahley ( anbiya (Alaihissalam) mein se aik Nabi ko kisi chewnti ne kaat liya, unhon-ne chewntiyon ki poori basti ke barey mein hukm diya to wo jalaa di gaee. is par Allah Taala ne unki taraf wahi ki ke aik chewnti ke kaatney ki wjah se aap ne ummaton mein se aik aisi ummat ( badi aabadi ( ko halaak kar diya, jo Allah ki tasbeeh karti thi?"
"6149","Saeed-bin-Musaiyab aur abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : (pahley ( anbiya (Alaihissalam) mein se aik Nabi ko kisi chewnti ne kaat liya, unhon-ne chewntiyon ki poori basti ke barey mein hukm diya to wo jalaa di gaee. is par Allah Taala ne unki taraf wahi ki ke aik chewnti ke kaatney ki wjah se aap ne ummaton mein se aik aisi ummat ( badi aabadi ( ko halaak kar diya, jo Allah ki tasbeeh karti thi?"
"6150","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : (pahley ( anbiya (Alaihissalam) mein se aik Nabi aik darakht ke nichey (aaraam karne ke liye sawari se) utrey to aik chewnti ne unko kaat liya. unhon-ne iske poorey bil ke barey mein hukm diya, usey bil se nikal diya gaya phir hukm diya unko jalaa diya gaya. Allah Taala ne unki taraf wahi ki ke aap ne aik hi chewnti ko kyon ( saza ( na (di?)"
"6151","Aaraj ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : (pahley ( anbiya (Alaihissalam) mein se aik Nabi aik darakht ke nichey (aaraam karne ke liye sawari se) utrey to aik chewnti ne unko kaat liya. unhon-ne iske poorey bil ke barey mein hukm diya, usey bil se nikal diya gaya phir hukm diya unko jalaa diya gaya. Allah Taala ne unki taraf wahi ki ke aap ne aik hi chewnti ko kyon ( saza ( na (di?)"
"6152","Hammam-bin-Munabba ne kaha : ye hadisein hain jo hamein Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kin, phir unhon-ne kuchh hadisein zikr kin, unmein se aik ye hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : (pahley) anbiya (Alaihissalam) mein se aik Nabi aik darakht ke nichey letey they, unhein aik chewnti ne kaat liya, unhon-ne unki poori aabadi ke barey mein hukm diya, usey nichey se (khodkar) nikal liya gaya, phir uske barey mein hukm diya to us (poori aabadi) ko aag se jalaa diya gaya. to Allah Taala ne unki taraf wahi ki, (is aik hi ko kyon ( saza ( na ( di ? ("
"6153","Hammam-bin-Munabba ne kaha : ye hadisein hain jo hamein Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kin, phir unhon-ne kuchh hadisein zikr kin, unmein se aik ye hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : (pahley) anbiya (Alaihissalam) mein se aik Nabi aik darakht ke nichey letey they, unhein aik chewnti ne kaat liya, unhon-ne unki poori aabadi ke barey mein hukm diya, usey nichey se (khodkar) nikal liya gaya, phir uske barey mein hukm diya to us (poori aabadi) ko aag se jalaa diya gaya. to Allah Taala ne unki taraf wahi ki, (is aik hi ko kyon ( saza ( na ( di ? ("
"6154","Juweriya bin Asma ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin umr (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik aurat ko billi ke sabab se azab diya gaya, us ne billi ko qaid karke rakha yahan tak ke wo mar gaee. wo aurat uski wjah se jahannam mein chali gaee, us aurat ne jab billi ko qaid kya to na usko khilaaya-pilaya aur na usko chhoda hi ke wo zamin ke andar aur uper rehney waley chhotey chhotey janwar kha leti."
"6155","Juweriya bin Asma ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abdullah (bin umr (Raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat ki, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik aurat ko billi ke sabab se azab diya gaya, us ne billi ko qaid karke rakha yahan tak ke wo mar gaee. wo aurat uski wjah se jahannam mein chali gaee, us aurat ne jab billi ko qaid kya to na usko khilaaya-pilaya aur na usko chhoda hi ke wo zamin ke andar aur uper rehney waley chhotey chhotey janwar kha leti."
"6156","Ubaidullah-bin-Umar ne Naafe se aur unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, isi tarah ( Ubaidullah-bin-Umar ne) Saeed Maqbari se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us hadis ke ham mana hadis riwayat ki."
"6157","Ubaidullah-bin-Umar ne Naafe se aur unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki, isi tarah ( Ubaidullah-bin-Umar ne) Saeed Maqbari se aur unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us hadis ke ham mana hadis riwayat ki."
"6158","Malik ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi riwayat ki."
"6159","Malik ne Naafe se, unhon-ne Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi riwayat ki."
"6160","Abda ne Hisham (bin Urwa) se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik aurat ko billi ke mamley mein azab diya gaya. us aurat ne na usey khilaya na pilaya aur na usko chhoda ke wo zamin ke chhotey janwar kha leti ."
"6161","Abda ne Hisham (bin Urwa) se, unhon-ne apne walid se, unhon-ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik aurat ko billi ke mamley mein azab diya gaya. us aurat ne na usey khilaya na pilaya aur na usko chhoda ke wo zamin ke chhotey janwar kha leti ."
"6162","abu-Muawiya aur Khalid-bin Haris ne hamein hadis sunai kaha : hamein Hisham ne isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, un donon ki hadis mein hai is aurat ne usey baandh diya aur abu-Muawia ki hadis mein hai : hashraatul-arz (kha leti)"
"6163","abu-Muawiya aur Khalid-bin Haris ne hamein hadis sunai kaha : hamein Hisham ne isi sanad ke sath hadis bayan ki, un donon ki hadis mein hai is aurat ne usey baandh diya aur abu-Muawia ki hadis mein hai : hashraatul-arz (kha leti)"
"6164","Humaid bin Abdur-Rehman ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Hisham ki us hadis ke ham-mana riwayat ki."
"6165","Humaid bin Abdur-Rehman ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Hisham ki us hadis ke ham-mana riwayat ki."
"6166","Hammam-bin-Munabba ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, unki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6167","Hammam-bin-Munabba ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, unki hadis ki tarah riwayat ki."
"6168","Abu-Saleh samaan ne Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aik baar aik shakhs rastey mein chala ja raha tha usko shadeed piyaas lagi , usey aik kunwaan mila wo us kuwein mein utra aur pani piya, phir wo kuwein se nikla to uske samney aik kutta zor-zor se haanp raha tha, piyaas ki wjah se keechad chaat raha tha, us shakhs ne (dil mein) kaha : ye kutta bhi piyaas se usi haalat ko pahuncha hai jo meri hui thi. wo kuwein mein utra aur apne mozey ko pani se bharaa phir usko munh se pakda yahan tak ke uper chadh aaya, phir us ne kuttey ko pani pilaya . Allah Taala ne usey us neki ka badla diya usko bakhsh diya. logon ne kaha : Allah ke rasool! hamarey liye un janwaron mein ajr hai? to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : nami rakhney waley har jigar main ( kisi bhi jaandaar ka ho. ( ajr hai."